<title>USA: Melamine Chemicals hires Goldman, Sachs.</title>
<headline>Melamine Chemicals hires Goldman, Sachs.</headline>
<dateline>DONALDSONVILLE, La. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Melamine Chemicals Inc said Wednesday that it has engaged Goldman Sachs &amp; Co as its financial adviser.</p>
<p>The hiring comes after Melamine received an offer from Ashland Inc to buy all the outstanding shares of the company that Ashland does not own for $12.50 in cash per share. Melamine said it will respond to Ashland's offer after considering its alternatives.</p>
<p>Melamine is engaged in the production and marketing of the chemical melamine, which is used in adhesives, laminates, paints and other products.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
